dsh-desktop-kit README · Configuration：Shell argv: `dsh-desktop-kit [url] [title]` — the plugin supplies an authenticated URL; standalone defaults remain `http://127.0.0.1:3080` and `DSH`.
`--selftest` runs a scriptable native-fullscreen enter/exit check (exit 0 on pass);
`DSH_KIT_NO_SINGLE_INSTANCE=1` runs a side-by-side instance (selftest, dev).
